ResY: 720Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:53.84,Title,,0,0,0,,Buster CallDialogue: 1,0:01:50.00,0:01:53.84,Title,,0,0,0,,Buster CallDialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:15.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, look at that! I've never seen this before!Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.78,0:02:20.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've never even heard anyone talking about it!Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:25.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Incredible! The Gates of Justice are completely open!Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:28.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's so that the battleships from Headquarters can get through!Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:31.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's for the buster call's bombardment!Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.55,0:02:38.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Old Lady Kokoro said...Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.05,0:02:41.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that those doors never  open all the way.Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.26,0:02:47.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is alarming. What the hell is a "buster call"-waina?Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:49.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats picked a fight with the world.Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.69,0:02:52.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So the Navy's ready to obliterate this entire island with them on it-waina!Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.86,0:02:54.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.65,0:02:57.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't die, Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:02:59.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.11,0:03:00.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back in one piece!Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:03.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.17,0:03:21.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I left saving Robin to Franky.Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.64,0:03:27.72,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I was careless. I never expected him to be this powerful.Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:31.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You seem to be struggling to breathe.Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.19,0:03:33.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it because of that steam?Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:43.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care, as long as I defeat you.Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.95,0:03:49.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. You're tenacious.Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:52.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got to get there in time!Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:55.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't go anywhere, Nico Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:04:00.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guards, outside!Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.05,0:04:01.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.97,0:04:10.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sentries of the Gates of Justice...Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.41,0:04:13.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and marines of the Navy Headquarters escort,Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.35,0:04:18.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief Spandam of Cipher Pol No. 9 is currently...Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.53,0:04:24.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hauling a nefarious criminal across the bridge from the Tower of Justice.Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:27.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fall in and salute!Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:28.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:41.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at that. We're all ready to set sail.Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.01,0:04:43.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing stands in my way now.Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.43,0:04:50.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, Nico Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:53.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll let you in on a little secret.Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:05:00.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I activated a landmine that's set at the top of the stairs back there.Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.61,0:05:05.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If, by any chance, someone tries to make their way here,Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.03,0:05:10.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the stairs will go boom, sending them flying!Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.95,0:05:13.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you think? Isn't that exciting?Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.20,0:05:16.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, don't worry about it,Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.37,0:05:19.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,since no one's gonna make it to those stairs anyway.Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.87,0:05:27.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I won't go through... the gate...Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:28.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:40.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because they said they'd rescue me.Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.31,0:05:43.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No one's coming, you dumb broad!Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.90,0:05:48.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll all burn to death in the raging inferno of a buster call!Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:57.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'll even erase the utter humiliation of those pirates torching our sacred flag!Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.50,0:06:04.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just like when that giant marine attacked us on Ohara twenty years ago.Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:07.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, walk!Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.76,0:06:10.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Walk with your own two feet!Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:11.76,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Saul...Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.85,0:06:14.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bitch!Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.35,0:06:19.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief! Please hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.35,0:06:23.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know! Shut up! I'm a hero!Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.23,0:06:26.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You probably thought that I didn't  know anything about it, didn't you?Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.36,0:06:31.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The misconduct by Jaguar D. Saul, a former Navy Headquarters vice admiral...Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:37.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your mother, Olvia... What happened on Ohara back then...Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.33,0:06:40.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know all about it!Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:43.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do you think that is?Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.75,0:06:45.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's because I was told.Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:50.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The man who commanded the raid on Ohara—the land of devils—Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.59,0:06:55.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,exposed their terrible crimes, and issued a buster call...Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.72,0:06:59.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,was the then-CP9 chief—and my old man—Spandine!Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.98,0:07:07.03,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Well, scholars of Ohara!Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.69,0:07:11.32,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I have found your crimes worthy of death!Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.57,0:07:14.33,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Eliminate him!Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.25,0:07:26.67,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Professor!Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:31.13,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Ohara...Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.51,0:07:36.60,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,knows too much.Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.01,0:07:38.77,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,It's time for a buster call!Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.35,0:07:40.73,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Ohara.Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:52.70,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Now, go, Saul!Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.29,0:07:56.99,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.99,0:07:57.74,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.24,0:08:02.16,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna go! I'll stay with you! Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.16,0:08:04.88,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:07.80,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I was happy to hear you call me that.Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:09.76,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.51,0:08:13.30,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,From now on, for you and me both...Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.30,0:08:14.84,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Live, Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.19,0:08:28.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They thought that everyone on Ohara had died,Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.73,0:08:32.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but the government missed one brat who escaped.Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.11,0:08:35.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How was it?Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.53,0:08:38.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many times were you hunted down by adults...Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.78,0:08:41.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who hoped to get rich by killing some eight-year-old kid?Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.58,0:08:47.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You couldn't trust anyone who approached you.Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.04,0:08:51.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You had nowhere to sleep safe and sound. No food.Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:56.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't even wanna imagine how crappy the last twenty years were for you.Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.49,0:09:01.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was so miserable, it makes you wanna cry?Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:05.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The person who put a bounty on your head twenty years ago...Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:07.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,was my old man!Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.56,0:09:10.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He did it for world peace!Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.11,0:09:20.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, twenty years later, his son hunts down the only survivor...Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.28,0:09:23.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and brings the battle of Ohara to its end.Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.41,0:09:26.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ohara lost!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.34,0:09:32.34,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Robin! Hold your head high, Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.55,0:09:37.51,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Your mom is honorable! Ohara is honorable!Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.51,0:09:41.76,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Someday, pass down this island's history, Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.22,0:09:45.85,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Ohara fought against the world!Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.90,0:09:54.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm still alive!Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.10,0:09:58.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you're gonna die, aren't you?! Right?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.75,0:10:09.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.13,0:10:19.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C-Cutty Flam! What is he doing here?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.47,0:10:22.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that's fine. The trap worked! What an idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.39,0:10:24.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That moron triggered the landmine!Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.81,0:10:28.77,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,He came to rescue me!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:32.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yikes. That's no good. I'm glad I planned ahead.Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.77,0:10:35.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've gotta hurry. Come on!Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.11,0:10:39.03,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I have no words.Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.03,0:10:42.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, marines! Set sail! I'll jump on!Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.99,0:10:45.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir! Roger!Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:46.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're setting sail!Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.41,0:10:47.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:51.08,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so upset, I can't stop crying!Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.30,0:10:57.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Behold!Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.21,0:11:02.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here is the first step of a hero that history will long remem–Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.60,0:11:14.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.57,0:11:18.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Chief?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:20.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that?! Who did this?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:22.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no one on the bridge!Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.49,0:11:26.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There must be! They must be hiding somewhere! Find them!Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:28.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are they?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.13,0:11:42.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! What're you guys doing?! You're all worthless!Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.13,0:11:45.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, Chief, we can't locate the enemy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.39,0:11:50.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! There he is!Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.74,0:12:09.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On top of the Tower of Justice!Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.62,0:12:14.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Tower of Justice?! What can he do from all the way up there?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.67,0:12:23.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Zing! – Who the hell is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.01,0:12:28.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's hitting us dead on, at that distance, in this wind?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:30.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.39,0:12:32.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Long Nose-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:37.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See that?! Our sniper is damn impressive!Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.61,0:12:41.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn well serves them right!Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.07,0:12:42.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-chan! Run!Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:45.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does he really have to sing?Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.70,0:12:48.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:52.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief!Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.08,0:13:00.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! What're you guys doing?! Shoot him already!Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.13,0:13:05.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're trying, but our bullets don't reach that far, much less hit him!Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.26,0:13:08.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sniper's got outstanding aim!Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:10.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin is getting away!Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:13.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let her get away! Idiots! You can shoot her!Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.68,0:13:16.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes, sir! – Shoot her dead enough to keep her alive!Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:17.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.29,0:13:32.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:51.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.06,0:13:52.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.82,0:14:12.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.70,0:14:14.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's you.Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.54,0:14:19.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm solid iron, baby.Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.67,0:14:21.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That landmine wasn't cool, Spanda!Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:22.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eek!Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.21,0:14:27.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Er, Franky-kun, Franky-kun. This is Sogeking.Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.77,0:14:30.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? Oh? How'd you get this transponder snail?Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.97,0:14:32.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From Nami.Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.81,0:14:37.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More importantly, you should find a red  cloth bundle on the ground near you.Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.64,0:14:38.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Red cloth?Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.89,0:14:40.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I see it!Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.10,0:14:42.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It has two keys in it.Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.27,0:14:45.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With your keys, you should have them all now.Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.19,0:14:48.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All the keys?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.78,0:14:51.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I delivered them to you right on target.Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.91,0:14:54.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mission accomplished.Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.29,0:14:57.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry. This isn't good.Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.45,0:14:59.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. 1...Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:00.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. 3...Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.42,0:15:02.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. 4... Doesn't work!Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:03.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. 5!Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.09,0:15:06.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They came off!Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.93,0:15:13.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nonsense! Th-They're the real keys?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.01,0:15:18.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey. Pull yourself together!Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.14,0:15:20.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. That means...Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.56,0:15:27.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh! You guys defeated all the CP9 agents in the Tower of Justice?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.37,0:15:37.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, that can't be true!Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.04,0:15:40.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must've stolen them and ran! Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.62,0:15:44.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Franky! Hey, Long Nose!Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.88,0:15:47.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I uncuffed Nico Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.46,0:15:48.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice!Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.30,0:15:51.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Long Nose-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.05,0:15:57.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank those who fought bravely to get the keys when this is all over.Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.93,0:16:02.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are, without a doubt, one of Luffy-kun's crew!Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.14,0:16:04.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can now do as you wish!Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.23,0:16:07.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.94,0:16:11.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seis Fleur!Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.70,0:16:14.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:15.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Slap!Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.91,0:16:21.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa.Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.89,0:16:26.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll do this to my heart's content.Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:38.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief!Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:41.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, guys! Hurry and get over here!Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.35,0:16:43.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll get things ready for our escape!Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.89,0:16:45.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger!Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.52,0:16:48.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come down already, Sogeking!Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.61,0:16:52.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is bad! The criminal is free of the seastone handcuffs!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.44,0:16:54.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Capture her again!Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.74,0:16:59.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everything went according to my plan.Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.29,0:17:03.83,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? What's that?Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:08.84,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Did I hear something just now?Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.31,0:17:23.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.64,0:17:26.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck?Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.23,0:17:33.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't be!Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.78,0:17:38.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was that cannon fire from a battleship?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.66,0:17:39.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The stockade!Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:51.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral, that last shot struck the main island's stockade nearest to our four o'clock!Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.55,0:17:53.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– And? – Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.59,0:17:55.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm asking, what's your point?Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:57.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Well, nothing really, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.80,0:18:02.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is an indiscriminate attack. I could care less where we hit.Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.31,0:18:03.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.27,0:18:07.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our mission is to burn it all down.Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:12.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They decimated the fence that surrounds the island.Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:13.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was a huge explosion.Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.44,0:18:18.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If a bunch of battleships comes and rains down cannon fire like that...Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.61,0:18:19.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also, look.Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.24,0:18:27.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those violently surging whirlpools that kept ships away are now gone.Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:31.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's because the Gates of Justice were opened all the way to allow the attack.Dialogue: 3,0:18:31.42,0:18:36.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those enormous gates blocked the sea currents, causing those whirlpools.Dialogue: 3,0:18:36.13,0:18:39.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that the gates are open  and nothing is blocking them,Dialogue: 3,0:18:39.18,0:18:41.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the sea currents returned to normal,Dialogue: 3,0:18:41.30,0:18:43.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the whirlpools disappeared, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.85,0:18:45.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which means, the battleships...Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.39,0:18:47.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,will have no trouble approaching the island.Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:52.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sogeking! – There's no time to lose!Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:53.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jump down from there!Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:18:57.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How reckless!Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.57,0:19:02.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First off, it's not like I have superhuman strength like you guys,Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:05.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or the courage not to fear death!Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:08.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm just a garden-variety superhero!Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.79,0:19:09.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.88,0:19:14.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:17.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Tower of Justice!Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.34,0:19:19.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Long Nose-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.55,0:19:20.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Long Nose!Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.72,0:19:23.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look! This time, they hit the Tower of Justice!Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.39,0:19:25.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Tower of Justice!Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.06,0:19:28.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are they okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.98,0:19:38.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As I suspected, the sound earlier was no ordinary explosion!Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.15,0:19:39.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was cannon fire!Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.90,0:19:41.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry and leave the island!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.49,0:20:22.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait. He didn't just... right?Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.20,0:20:26.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:29.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahhh!!Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.79,0:20:32.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You called?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.17,0:20:40.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're alive!Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:43.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't you guys have the decency to catch a hero...Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.43,0:20:46.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,making a desperate jump off the rooftop?! Morons!Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:52.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky! Robin-chan! We're okay here. We're heading over right away!Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:54.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a relief.Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.73,0:20:57.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, let's do something about things here.Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.11,0:20:59.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, can I count on you to help fight?Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.78,0:21:01.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course.Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.23,0:21:05.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, soldiers! Take care of them before the attack kicks into full gear!Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:06.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.91,0:21:09.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's an escort ship on the other side of the bridge, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.79,0:21:12.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could that be the key to our escape?Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.70,0:21:15.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like stealing that ship is our only chance for survival.Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.87,0:21:17.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get them!Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.71,0:21:23.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Razor!Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.01,0:21:30.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jet Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.83,0:21:53.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I understand now.Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.29,0:21:58.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're basically doping.Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.04,0:22:01.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You accelerate your circulation by using your legs as a pump.Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.88,0:22:06.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The blood pressure gets so high that a normal person's heart would burst,Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.80,0:22:10.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but since your organs and blood vessels are rubber, you can withstand the pressure.Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.43,0:22:12.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a technique only a rubber man could use.Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.14,0:22:17.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While your physical abilities spike above their usual limits,Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.56,0:22:21.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you don't have the stamina to keep up the intensity.Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.27,0:22:25.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not really smart. You know you're shortening your life, right?Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.32,0:22:29.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's better than losing everything right before my eyes!Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.82,0:22:32.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I do whatever I can!Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.24,0:22:34.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're too ambitious!Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:38.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you feel the explosion earlier?Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.71,0:22:42.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was probably a battleship from Navy Headquarters running a firing drill.Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.75,0:22:46.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Before too long, they'll begin their barrage.Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.26,0:22:50.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your friends who are in the Tower of Justice will die there.Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.39,0:22:56.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe some of them are lucky enough to be running down the tunnel to get here.Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.27,0:22:58.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.40,0:23:08.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.41,0:23:21.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This seawater will flood the passage,Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.88,0:23:24.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ensuring that anyone in there will drown.Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.00,0:23:39.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard.Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.52,0:23:44.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing is going well for you, Straw Hat.Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.44,0:23:49.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have this naive idea that you can save everyone and escape.Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.56,0:23:51.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's see how far it gets you.Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.03,0:23:53.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you doing, you jerk?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.09,0:24:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kokoro-san! Chimney! Gonbe!Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.47,0:24:15.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the directions!Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.01,0:24:19.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirate Lady!Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.73,0:24:23.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I felt quite a shock just a moment ago.Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.19,0:24:27.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's finally gonna start, huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.40,0:24:29.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cannon fire! Cannon fire!Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.76,0:24:54.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.13,0:24:57.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is capture Nico Robin and put her on the escort ship!Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.43,0:24:59.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move it! The battleships are coming!Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.89,0:25:02.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like we're too late.Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.10,0:25:03.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.48,0:25:04.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah!Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.48,0:25:05.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh!Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.31,0:25:09.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Through the fog,Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.98,0:25:11.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we can see the ships' outlines!Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.28,0:25:15.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, don't run away! Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.79,0:25:23.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.08,0:25:28.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This serves you right!Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.38,0:25:31.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're here! They're finally here!Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.68,0:26:21.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A fleet of battleships!Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.05,0:26:24.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The buster call has begun!Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.00,0:12:28.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ I was born... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.04,0:12:31.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ on the island of snipers. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.02,0:12:40.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ Or even your heart... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.65,0:12:45.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ Lock on!! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.33,0:17:57.80,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Justice"Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.42,0:18:43.39,Captions,,0,0,0,,m -101 -60 l 95 -60 95 15 -101 15Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.42,0:18:43.39,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sea CurrentsDialogue: 0,0:18:31.42,0:18:43.39,Captions,,0,0,0,,m -171 16 l 109 16 109 104 -171 104Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.42,0:18:43.39,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:26:22.35,0:26:25.31,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: PhosCity  Quality Control: danpmss, Galaxy 9000, Grug, ItsKipz, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:00:00.71,0:00:03.37,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get runningDialogue: 0,0:00:03.59,0:00:06.46,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,holding our flag high in the skyDialogue: 0,0:00:12.77,0:00:18.06,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Cross this endless sea with me and search for Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:21.81,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,a global miracle no oneDialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:23.94,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,has yet been able to findDialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:27.96,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,With our hearts pounding,Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:29.71,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we'll just charge ahead as we please, following Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:35.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the footprints of those who pursue their dreams Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:39.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No matter how stormy the night,Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:42.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,if we put our minds together, Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:46.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we'll get through it Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:47.86,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,alwaysDialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:51.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get runningDialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:54.55,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,holding our flag high in the skyDialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:57.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Even though there are tearsDialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:01:00.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we don't want anyone to seeDialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:03.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing, keep chasing Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.69,0:01:06.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the compass that leads to our dreams Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.61,0:01:09.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,always points straight ahead Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:11.40,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We can't stop hereDialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:21.49,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get running,Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:24.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,head past everyone elseDialogue: 0,0:01:24.63,0:01:27.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,So long as we don't run from it,Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.22,0:01:30.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we can take hold of tomorrow Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:33.63,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing, keep chasing Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:36.51,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,everything we see in the moment,Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.93,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we should record it all Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:41.43,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,in the blank slates of our minds Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:41.62,Kanji,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HDialogue: 2,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 2,0:00:00.21,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.24,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 2,0:00:00.28,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,